__vfs['data/lan9118/PublicEventMod/2.5.3 - 261030/en/update.lua'] = [[return 'Current Version: 2.5.3 - 261030\n\n----- Public Release -----\n2.5.3 - 261030\nAdded:\n- Unlock: "Stocker" Legendary Skin "10th Anniversary"\n- Currencies: "Climb Coin, Canyon Coin, Climb Relic, Loyalty Bits"\n- Chest: "10th Anniversary"\n- Adventures: "Countryside, The Great Below"\n- Headwear: "The Great Below"\n- Integrated the newly added content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\nAdjusted:\n- Quantity of certain currencies obtained\n-----\n2.5.2 - 261028\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: ATV Legendary Paint "Oldbill"\n- Added unlock: Offroader Legendary Paint "Halloween26"\n- Added unlock: Legendary Driver Skin "Embersoot, Mollis Tattimus, Papa Bill"\n- Integrated the newly added content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\nAdjusted:\n- Adjusted the acquisition amounts of some currencies\n-----\n2.5.1 - 261022\nAdded:\n- Support patching events in other spaces\nFixed:\n- Fixed an issue where events in the current space could not be patched when multiple spaces were present\n-----\n2.5.0 - 261017\nAdded:\n- Added English language support\nImproved:\n- The Patch / Restore Event interface can now display event names and IDs\n- Adjusted the naming format of modified events\n- Improved the display of some text\n- Removed the startup notification\n- Improved the warning message displayed when using a non-zGG modder\n-----\n2.4.4 - 261016\nFixed:\n- Fixed an issue where some tires for Jeep and Stocker could not be unlocked\n-----\n2.4.3 - 261016\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: Havoc Legendary Paint "Angler"\n- Integrated the newly added content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\n-----\n2.4.2 - 261006\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: Stocker Mythic Paint "Flame"\n- Integrated the newly added content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\n-----\n2.4.1 - 261002\nAdded:\n- Added vehicle-specific Style Chests for Mk2, Dune Buggy, Sports Car, Super Diesel, and Raider\nImproved:\n- Reduced the risk of account bans (Claiming the first reward slot is currently not recommended, as it may result in an account ban)\nFixed:\n- Fixed an issue where some paints/tires for Motocross and Havoc could not be unlocked\n-----\n2.4.0 - 260905\nAdded:\n- Added "Script Information" to the main menu\n- Added unlock: Havoc, including fully upgraded body, all paints, vehicle accessories, and parts\n- Added unlock: Legendary Driver Skin "Uncle Gary"\n- Added unlock: HILL CLIMBER Mk2 Legendary Paint "Swim"\n- Added unlock: Tinfoil Legendary Hat\n- Integrated all newly added content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\n- Added vehicle-specific chests for all vehicles\nAdjusted & Improved:\n- Adjusted the amounts of currencies and resources obtained\n- Reordered some event reward slots\nFixed:\n- Fixed an issue where incorrect cloud data checks caused the script to incorrectly display "This script has been disabled"\nRemoved:\n- Removed the "Unlock Hidden Vehicles" reward to prevent chest issues caused by vehicle order dependencies\n- Removed the "Unlock New Poses" reward slot\n- Removed the feature that changed rotating event reward refresh time to 5 seconds\n- Removed "Show Path"\n- Removed "Disable Notifications"\n-----\n2.3.1 - 260622\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: Superbike Legendary Paint "Racing Blue"\n- Integrated the new content into the one-click unlock and corresponding reward slots\n-----\n2.3 - 260615\nUpdated:\n- Added a feature menu with Nickname Changer, Free Chests, Fake VIP, and Game Scaling\n- Added an "End Process" option to the settings menu to force-stop the game\n- Changed "Restore Event" to restore events using custom files (takes effect after restarting the game)\n- Made all event items infinitely purchasable, except for some rotating event rewards and special feature items\n- Made all event items free to purchase\n- Made special feature items free to purchase (only effective during special events)\n- Changed rotating event reward refresh time to 5 seconds\n- Improved some text displays\n-----\n2.2.1 - 260604\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: Stocker Legendary Paint "Drak"\n- Integrated the new content into the one-click unlock and corresponding reward slots\n- Removed three redundant test slots\n-----\n2.2 - 260531\nAdded:\n- Added a "Restore Event Rewards" feature to the Event menu (takes effect after restarting the game)\n- Changed the cloud data retrieval URL\n- Changed the modified event name to "Public Event Mod"\n- Increased Style Shards acquisition to 10 per level\n- Adjusted the amount of Style Points obtained\n-----\n2.1 - 260530\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: Mythic Parts for all vehicles\n- Added currency: Style Points\n- Added resource: Style Shards\n- Added Mythic Chests and Style Chests\n- Added the Mythic part rarity\n- Added unlock: Driver Skin "Box Bill"\n- Added unlock: Sports Car Legendary Paint "Drifting Pink"\n- Added unlock: Tank Legendary Paint "Pineapple"\n- Integrated the new content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\n- Fixed an issue where some Bus paints could not be unlocked\n- Fixed an issue where some Snowmobile paints could not be unlocked\n- Fixed an issue where some Moonlander tires could not be unlocked\n- Fixed an issue where some Stocker paints/tires could not be unlocked\n-----\n2.0 - 260426\nUpdated:\n- Migrated the script to the cloud, enabling online updates via GitHub so that a single script can always access the latest version\n- Fixed various bugs and optimized the script\nRemoved:\n- Removed customizable reward slots (3–7), which allowed individual content unlocks\n- Removed custom unlock quantities\n- Removed vehicle-specific chests for all vehicles\n\n----- Beta Releases -----\n1.2 - 260409 Beta\nAdded:\n- Added all driver cosmetics and parts of every rarity (obtained randomly)\n- Added vehicle-specific chests for all vehicles\n-----\n1.1 - 260329 Beta\nAdded:\n- Added unlock: Stocker, including fully upgraded body, vehicle accessories, all paints, and parts\n- Added all currencies from the new Adventure Shop\n- Integrated the new content into the one-click unlock and other reward slots\n- Added customizable reward slots (3–7) for individual content unlocks\n- Added custom unlock quantities\n- Reordered some event reward slots\n- Fixed an issue where the Mountain Adventure accessory could not be unlocked\n- Fixed an issue where the Tank M1 paint could not be unlocked\n- Fixed an issue where daily event rewards were incorrectly removed\n- Compressed and optimized the script to reduce crashes and improve performance\n(Cloud update functionality was planned for a future release to prevent newly added content from being missed during unlocks)\n-----\n1.0 - 260202 Beta\nThe initial creation of the Public Event Mod project and its first release'
]]

